LOCAL.md

# The tailnet node's own identity, written by the Tailscale container. It is a
# PRIVATE KEY. Committing it would hand anyone who reads this repository a
# machine on the tailnet - and this repository is public. The serve config
# beside it holds no secrets and is tracked on purpose.
tailscale/state/
